			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d5565b5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="d5565b5" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									Welcome to Midwest Tropical, the most experienced <strong>designer and fabricator of custom water features</strong>. For almost fifty years, we’ve been acknowledged for pioneering and perfecting a variety of innovative, award-winning water feature designs, including <a href="/bubble-walls/">Bubble Walls</a>, <a href="/tile-water-walls-and-waterfalls/">Indoor Waterfalls</a>, <a href="/rain-curtains/">Rain Curtains</a>, <a href="/water-walls/">Water Walls</a>, and <ahref="/reflection-pools/">Reflection Pools</a>.
<br><br>
<span>Midwest Tropical is known as the <strong>premier manufacturer of high quality, low-maintenance, water features</strong> and offers nationwide installation. We have built many large-scale water feature projects around the world, including a Bubble Wall spanning 50 feet wide for a children’s hospital in Michigan.</span>								</div>
					</div>
		</div>
				<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0d253ae" data-id="0d253ae" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
