						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-dcc9e8b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="dcc9e8b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Since 1977, we’ve been building custom water features in our state-of-the-art facility in Skokie, Illinois and are proud to have our water features <strong>“Made in America”</strong> by trained craftsmen with decades of experience.  We have invented and innovated some of the most popular water feature designs including the patented Bubble Wall, invented by our founder, and <strong>maintenance-free Enclosed Water Walls</strong>!</p><p>Our name may be Midwest Tropical, but we’ve installed stunning features in <strong>every state of the U.S.A. and around the world</strong>.  In addition to building the finest water features, we offer turn-key nationwide installations for our custom water features.</p>								</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
