									<h2 style="text-align: center;">Confidence Sealed into Every Midwest Water Feature</h2><p>Get peace of mind with every custom feature we craft from Midwest tropical water fountains, Midwest Tropical Waterfalls and Waterwalls. Put your concerns about leakage away. Sealing displays upright and tight is the number one focus at Midwest Water Features, and over the many years we’ve been in business, we’ve innovated and improved the physical beauty, functionality, and structural integrity of our products. Count on the trust earned through Midwest’s dedication to exceptional products and pleased clients worldwide.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a093d9a elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="a093d9a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><strong>WATERPROOFING</strong>. Effective waterproofing is achieved through Midwest’s top-of-the-line liners, sealants, or membranes specifically designed for water containment.</p><p><strong>MATERIALS WITH NO COMPROMISE</strong>. Count on our selection of high-performance, long-lasting materials such as pipes, fittings, and connectors. They must be durable, corrosion-resistant, and specifically designed for water applications.</p><p><strong>PROPER SEALING AND JOINTS.</strong> We ensure all joints, connections, and seams perform to expectations and beyond. This includes using waterproofing sealants, gaskets, or rubber liners to seal any potential gaps or areas prone to leakage.</p><p><strong>ADEQUATE DRAINAGE AND OVERFLOW.</strong> Proper drainage and overflow systems are essential. Our proprietary systems allow excess water to be safely directed away from the feature, reducing the risk of leaks due to increased water volume.</p><p><strong>REGULAR MAINTENANCE AND INSPECTIONS.</strong> Routine maintenance and inspections are crucial to identify and address any potential issues before they develop into leaks or safety hazards.</p>								</div>
